### [Vector indexes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/s3-vectors-indexes.md)

- [Creating a vector index in a vector bucket](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/s3-vectors-create-index.md)
- [Changing a vector index's mode](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/s3-vectors-index-mode.md): A vector index whose index mode is ENHANCED applies your metadata filter before the vector search, ensuring high recall even when filters match a small fraction of vectors, and it supports the $startsWith filter operator.
- [Listing vector indexes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/s3-vectors-index-list.md): You can view all vector indexes within a vector bucket.
