### [Managing storage costs with Amazon S3 Intelligent-Tiering](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/intelligent-tiering.md)

Use S3 Intelligent-Tiering to optimize storage costs for data with unknown or changing access patterns.

