- [Using S3 Intelligent-Tiering](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/using-intelligent-tiering.md): You can use the S3 Intelligent-Tiering storage class to automatically optimize storage costs.
- [Managing S3 Intelligent-Tiering](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/intelligent-tiering-managing.md): Learn how to manage and restore Amazon S3 objects that are archived in the S3 Intelligent-Tiering archive tiers.

